        "~unsuitableForSpecificPerformance(P,K)",
        "~performanceCostExcessive(P,K)",
        "~creditorFailedToRequestInTime(O,K)"
      ],
      "heads": [
        {"type": "PERM", "bearer": "O", "counterparty": "P", "content": "claimPerformance(O,P)"}
      ],
      "note": "不履行非金钱债务或者履行不符合约定的，对方可以请求履行；但法律上或事实上不能履行、标的不适于强制履行或履行费用过高、债权人合理期限内未请求履行的除外",
      "auth": "npc"
    },
    {
      "key": "c580-2",
      "srcs": ["art580-2"],
